N2 Gumiho contains orchestration concepts and role prompts adapted from N2 Daebung.
The MIT notice for that code is retained in LICENSE.

n2-recipe provides mandatory lifecycle preparation, verification and durable
scoped outcome collection. Its MIT notice is retained in LICENSE-N2R.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-recipe

n2-mimir provides the common Soul SQLite schema and storage connections.
Its published distribution terms are retained in LICENSE-MIMIR and
LICENSE-MIMIR-APACHE. Its package includes additional upstream notices.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-mimir

n2-clotho provides the recipe parser and bundled WASM compiler through n2-recipe.
Its published distribution terms are retained in LICENSE-CLOTHO and LICENSE-APACHE.
Its own package also includes the MIT notice for adapted Daebung code.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-clotho

n2-personas provides generic task expertise through n2-recipe.
Its MIT notice is retained in LICENSE-PERSONAS.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-personas

Ajv, ajv-formats and better-sqlite3 are distributed under their MIT licenses.
Their notices and those of transitive dependencies remain in the installed
dependency packages. Consult those notices for the applicable terms.
